{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:656b4246e639528725d48a45fc71b0d57bf329d6d11408226472ccd6117a581f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2d19f8f9419ebde5d91506467b3bd945f6f34cbedb1f08ef60e760a08039cf",
      "text": "终结之音，启始之音",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9a72121bc82d73ba0cd35769ca0563c5662e7a50aa6165e6b7a271c41682df5",
      "text": "对自己奏出的音乐抱有绝对自信的\n神乐丽。然而在得知有人企图利用自己的演奏\n牟取暴利后，他变得无法再进行演奏。\n另一方面，都筑圭也正一个人\n在雨中徘徊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2d19f8f9419ebde5d91506467b3bd945f6f34cbedb1f08ef60e760a08039cf",
      "text": "终结之音，启始之音",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cded9e5bb89981c91f6644e1c616cfb2b4a06fc6ad35fea350649630ad597bd9",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb68ffebfd696d236afc1c576ce31856eb418f5643e12e2ec6b033984a371af",
      "text": "（啊啊，今天也传达到了。\n我所演奏的至高之音乐……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e0056c4eba911aecab13c33fdd428ef85eaffb9333ac4edce081a8e5ffd7a2",
      "text": "（这观众的笑容，以及\n经久不息的掌声就是满足的证明）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74481883ed2063eae5db8f4e89b725320a564553130e70416147e904010af73b",
      "text": "（为了让那些特地来听我演奏的人们，\n今后也绝不感到失望）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f361b729006d80a81b21ebdf86eeee67c330204a01492f45ea5517c64051193",
      "text": "（“重现作曲家心灵的演奏家”……\n必须展开不辱此评价的活动才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d28653ad67d10972b9b7c55ddccec5cc34cc9c63e39e24156c08096607164249",
      "text": "（……话说回来，\n这副光景多么美妙啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dd73f716e5b963ba6e2176869066322a49b2000dae82882e2e657c2025892a8",
      "text": "（在场的每一个人，都在为我的音色\n毫不吝惜地送上掌声）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ecde8776bee61b20f1f53e37d1c2ddbdb3415a2c1cabdadb3dc2cb725c9846f",
      "text": "（整个会场，都在深爱着我的音乐……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aac14e77ea9f092d2524ad18f555f14a9053153f1343bc8f23fa2fda406d429",
      "text": "（……真幸福。这里，才是我生存的归宿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a74084280b33e66e210c7c9ad0d6b08d2bf46498fbd4f314cd45351244a970ed",
      "text": "丽君，今天的小提琴也很棒哦！\n客人们也都非常满意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa292b6b4bc756d73c405f61455b756ab29c3f71c77214d457a3be223e92b220",
      "text": "场刊和CD也卖得像飞一样快哦。\n不愧是神乐丽君呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d74d66f0659dbdc496df344a05c1ce37f45c845cb0347200063a793cd6d683a",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n请问，我可以回后台了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e93b34bcc7b72e33eb48acde0f06765b59db3eccf6c208095c9a6d2f78321dbc",
      "text": "啊啊，不好意思不好意思。\n你一定很累了吧，好好休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3488f221f2f43e793e4e1b7216f6c3a2cc70d371cc068dd7109a9349fcc7f2d",
      "text": "那么，我先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ac365a4a6a3c331da58c4f81b7c8deb4a48a13b7843a92e287403f7a2fcb8c",
      "text": "……果然不错啊，神乐丽！\n是叫“重现作曲家心灵的演奏家”来着？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8c7ef006a736b0822df9c4304cce69230ccc7cb8e40a51d0553f96e70bc207b",
      "text": "只要他一演奏，\n大把大把的钞票就滚滚而来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f50507da17a15df9a06af203e4d3e7b35d6553dc9fc17b7a301315206ffa7e",
      "text": "确实呢，今天的销售额也是……\n看，有这么多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52beb3525f3d2709064870da22e7733802b0c762971726eefed186dbc51d7e66",
      "text": "（……唔。我明明还在附近，\n竟然说出这种话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78cb7a2259a8cf408c7ad2e9442e096448638e1847c7e20de184fbc03710030",
      "text": "（这场演奏会……不是为了音乐，\n而是为了金钱而准备的吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6713df9130cda48bf51f2b1af3b7b17c9a34a4c1cb7808ef4ffa91ce4b2a5542",
      "text": "数日后的演奏会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c81d4fc533602846407764104116e3542162984b593f6e8466a01b3562f5a34",
      "text": "（……自从听到了主办方的那番话之后）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:482d87133e913c66233cfb5c28f2e40dc7eab1b3588a6bf4f20a1ce7eb250879",
      "text": "（演奏时总是忍不住去想多余的事。\n我的音乐中，混入了杂音）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c3dc97a5ca1119e881a6995b120fa731174d638b27443dbc04ad8c9011d513e",
      "text": "（……主办这场演奏会，\n难道不是因为热爱我的音乐吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf4c4ac0fc5dd26d9ca90efd98da91d1b586d235349bf7244b899d9789aa51c",
      "text": "（这些观众们……\n难道根本就没有在听我的琴声吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41d2e6aad4e36f18db10a2d3b7edeeb13632629a012df601c3216f01f9dcf972",
      "text": "（……唔，手在发抖……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc",
      "text": "窸窸窣窣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97a4873050a1365b2e17969f3bf973cce6794a22a7086ae543d0412a8aa02b60",
      "text": "（平息下来……快平息下来，拜托了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc",
      "text": "窸窸窣窣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69314d50a6ae4c84f4a0ccbcb01c62d6df390c601ff361492788ae93eb5539a6",
      "text": "（……啊啊，不行了。再也无法，继续了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e31c725e6bc7e43dedd1d15e03d2a753d08b0bd19815cc8d5e2ee00039be99",
      "text": "实在非常抱歉。\n我，无法再继续……演奏下去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd622f9885a621e3b8cd6ce46363d06f6ff2a0913c6fd455db99df293fabb7d",
      "text": "神乐家宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48c26adc84dc424c34e41fb4ef89080688739c0604c53626b813d0954306f4d8",
      "text": "（从小开始，\n我就是为了成为小提琴家而一路走来的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9965af0dd7a33528b9e88a1d2b8ba20da69713389d21640f533759cd348a11e8",
      "text": "（小提琴是我的全部。\n音乐是我唯一的朋友）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a147c457f5581421f81a6511d06315c255bd97be64c29b2c6c0df28b16de5d2",
      "text": "（我一心一意地面对着音乐。\n然而……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd3a0749a1047107f00b6c2c12691d2d97341ba2283a647b5d0eb64a3d011b0f",
      "text": "（……对于不再演奏、无法带来金钱的\n神乐丽，他们毫无兴趣吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80fa3aced2b5bce2c627c19c5bf6881b0167e83bf092b8d75ddca3befbf39e5b",
      "text": "（曾经赞赏我的人们，全都一下子消失得无影无踪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe810a4dd506122d931a839cfc9976c92aafc26c2396f86b9b855d7675d2e58",
      "text": "归根结底只是为了钱而已。\n我的琴音，从一开始就根本没有人听。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d261433327b63ec105b3a14742d5118a04a253bcd9df3955c82b8cc43eed25c",
      "text": "大家听到的，不过是金钱的声音而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8c7ef006a736b0822df9c4304cce69230ccc7cb8e40a51d0553f96e70bc207b",
      "text": "只要他一演奏，\n大把大把的钞票就滚滚而来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb4464a32b8a0a690f0d7de03a9d000b4f6c846f830a52e0b990c562cbb6804",
      "text": "（不对……！我，\n才不是为了金钱而演奏的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f33c1a3126606a474ccb8881dab3be5015317bb70834e82230545fee49cf94",
      "text": "（我是为了热爱音乐的人们，在进行演奏的啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5da2c8c7e00fa5b46f3c9856a384891f585bfb113e7958690683f27b1390f743",
      "text": "（但是，如今无法再拉小提琴的我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619a8138566fb3977b55a36ef7ffe5f9dc3ee64b030d5696426849f7e81ceb26",
      "text": "……究竟，算是什么东西呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:787be0c4d0e9e28e856aa80a8c356d1bd9cf5330d25655cb1ab4497852ea5209",
      "text": "丽。\n今天也不拉小提琴吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bebbdf653ca4edbc1ba83b37a0ce7df8fbfad22fb0507c37ea223112b6bb64",
      "text": "现在的我，\n无法奏出优美的旋律。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf209a71439cf34b800c22903a04b232f45d5d5ebe92f034708777a4a4c2b796",
      "text": "又不是演奏会，\n放宽心拉就好啦。好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c82c148cb715d8cade2e1d99c2e307a24068f66c9e9b2c5d064bbc2fe71ab1",
      "text": "对了，丽。\n难得有空，我们一起演奏吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65b128abe107812a91a1f9086f3c56c003c422ed7187e8f5ae0654cba340542a",
      "text": "……对不起，姐姐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bbca4d5527940adea70cc90e18e6564e6f35aa08a2ebec7acb05f70309a3682",
      "text": "……对不起。\n是呢，强求你确实不太好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75c97bdb2a68c0cc4049e7b8ff5ca2bac37c89d525fdc0384c3695a9f544319d",
      "text": "可是，丽。如果不接触乐器的话，\n乐器和心灵之间就会产生距离的哦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7102b5f3e544ddabe3ae0610808c263755cdd2b1fb63f45bde8e21106803140c",
      "text": "……就算您不说，我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ea85cf3336f22a4726162fa8cb98f65d8f17688d8d50a0114eec630aa1168d",
      "text": "……对不起，是我失去理智了。\n姐姐说的话我十分明白。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da18070f905489505d15f4de89b5c8918303aa351e5781290521ef594532777",
      "text": "但是，再多……再多给我一点时间……\n让我思考一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff06c455d63bc6b275e16c5b66cc828b258a50f1bdcb1142f0cf64c8ed1fd48",
      "text": "丽。\n父亲和母亲也都很担心你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96653872df49b06ed7a0f89a526d246592720a6f2c5c4d800daa2cedd1fc2d7a",
      "text": "要是在这里呆着很难受的话，\n去别墅好好散散心如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8f1e1e2bb8ce973db0f7dabc6f4df9ccb3738aa2c4dbce5465600234e6cd1e6",
      "text": "无论身在何处都是一样的。\n我，无法像以前那样演奏了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5098362ccca523cf1f1ebf1cd4ed9c4da54b86768d9b7dee0cecc165df7c3c54",
      "text": "越是拉动琴弦……\n就越害怕金钱的声音会变得更响。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd411164877d6bad1820a9eaa49d85d7194166bfb694d462d6a0c3789e65887",
      "text": "……你真的感到非常痛苦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:222ac121046062ed32d21bc84d0325ec56a2f0cfe180983bea0e125a3f0714c2",
      "text": "正因如此，在一个空无一人的地方\n随心所欲地去演奏，你觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0291808810586bd68e041e637522a1ddd80c574c2d97e597a2c35f2e8f0941ef",
      "text": "在空无一人的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8315bb24892440e2aee279ca7d338ce0fc223c99d2a2a77de041529215e26b0d",
      "text": "是啊，在与利益毫无关系的地方演奏的话，\n或许就能从那道诅咒中摆脱出来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82c6196f8c6f752cf91ed1498ebeb16dd89b5e4ae584e0dbf9c05098905fd12",
      "text": "确实……如果在谁也听不到的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2384c0c6b72c417bbfcb955d3bed73fff3e29326036b89648f3281956db5f90c",
      "text": "去吧，去别墅吧。\n啊，不过一个人去可能会觉得寂寞吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae0ed52a2e39ee523817279402a4f37f81c4ff0aa34d8f8985ed7d6d40e4f871",
      "text": "让阿尔托也陪着你。好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a6eca051babec0be66b207fbc7e84717139d7fe635037a2eab9fbe346bdf96",
      "text": "汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2de19a16b74f0115d90c724146e11efcebf0f2f938ad1b460a54f121bf69611",
      "text": "真动听的声音啊……奏响着美妙的旋律……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f0136067f132d689e756eeb159a1847287404f645dd5776fc5e57b1e1ab357",
      "text": "……♪　……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7d06c3825af1f2df6ec48368d42b29082ef00f6d070c35ff3ba4f03a7bee04",
      "text": "下这么大的雨，恐怕很难进行发掘工作了吧。\n看来还是先回一趟事务所比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb2cce7621346cf22f97b6bbb9678e65d88f51dd838fa73bff16ebedb74e930",
      "text": "……咦，那种地方怎么有人。\n怎么回事呢，连伞也不撑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f0136067f132d689e756eeb159a1847287404f645dd5776fc5e57b1e1ab357",
      "text": "……♪　……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2c3736fd0da6b7ca0b0ec89a6dacae7365c967a58521a97fe4c7603403a36b9",
      "text": "这是何等优美的歌声……\n是站在那里的他在唱歌？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865446f149117b0f237fcc21f23b5913630ac07c35d143e941b0d141d44f4f60",
      "text": "雨声与歌声重叠在一起，\n简直宛如一段完满的音乐……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f0136067f132d689e756eeb159a1847287404f645dd5776fc5e57b1e1ab357",
      "text": "……♪　……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70dd8d724b350b886ff74aa555330bccb7d296bb63aa8381000c63fc6f3e3229",
      "text": "他的歌声，能改变世界……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c14ea48a35dcc7cfb8a4be8892f9a8c8bd9d684266705ac8accf72ce8bc56d",
      "text": "……？\n雨声变了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be5554af64619bfed8853a0c0498efdea3455356c7ccde035aba97b4578f1294",
      "text": "抱歉，擅自把伞撑了过来。\n我看您浑身都湿透了，忍不住就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03ee65a74511e13a452b3c73eb13c6b24b78c88d316d2e6fbbb1d00fa8dcbbe3",
      "text": "为什么在这么大的雨中，\n却不撑伞呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a7c4f6cb8c641b4b7a1589b08fac385e3318880a727d1c9e6d8cbbb6c568056",
      "text": "因为想沉浸在音乐中……\n伞，会妨碍声音。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbb17a7e05313685cff77d1f7100779d1817ff5467b2d711887f543e63907efa",
      "text": "声音……是雨声吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a12e43fa42aa94607956ffcfc8608753cd72e34d9a50658824c1249b4b0509",
      "text": "是啊。\n这是只有今天才能听到的音乐哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ba54f7087daffa0e6e7dfae0559e75570eac9c4bef4483335c567083332c22",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n但是，再这样下去会感冒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:968d829f1a29f112f53211e4592ccdb6b33f66db9a03e8179ef5fe1dc45a7f49",
      "text": "嗯，可能确实会呢。\n又要被朋友骂了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aceb5e9d4ba1189f9f78f27cecb8af3f10adb5c9a5d8b2a302d521bb23f735f6",
      "text": "还是先回家一趟比较好哦。\n我送您回去，请再往伞下站一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eee57d4eb5cacb8ae9a27a244d2aa6622daf8a5ee52e3922bbd03ce03eedb09e",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e2a0a2427d089c43cffbbea3b17fcc0a7b2e174de42dd071ccf087b78bb1b2",
      "text": "不过，你真是个奇怪的人呢。对素不相识的我\n搭话，还要送我回家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c3bfef3337b7e856060dd6dc1a677d3d2f1e2789905e1e2887ed685110a02cf",
      "text": "话说回来，您是从事\n音乐相关的工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0343dc3aa2a65b0387db6e14fed244a2ca4ba303783bf0c8345913aee2e4e3f5",
      "text": "为什么会这么想呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2255de95579899a8c0bc877e71117a0f1d0d72584c3952985a88d9cdf5817ada",
      "text": "因为您的歌声非常优美。\n突然问出这么奇怪的问题，真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0108df76abae1d9faf0988ae928ae39b075bae4d35a6b05a1357d38c01060c2",
      "text": "啊啊，原来你听到了\n我刚才唱的雨之旋律啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68a6a10be55444c761b1f11063c8f6a26d4ce575c49f8c34acec9a738d63e416",
      "text": "那你呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d2f064be8a875a81a12e6be7db440ddfbce274888f1dbd68ee68b4c6b32187",
      "text": "恕我冒昧还未自报家门。我是这家公司的……\n正在担任偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6ff32948ae14b316510dd22edc6b3cb1c882cd29bfa29052414f66a3bd2c9b3",
      "text": "315 Production？\n你是，制作人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a151aad0afc8bb6290972a982f49bc6b7cac695e162db8f86ef07d19d0fd0e",
      "text": "您的歌声中，有着能够魅惑人心的力量。\n如果可以的话，要不要尝试当偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a4f0b827cfb1cdebeacb59278de75d16a8f3ecb295f04da41f10ccd066d1a11",
      "text": "偶像……我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0a120b19802d1734a0bea683ec4f17b0a9f4cda13caba233b31e35a604d4389",
      "text": "是的！\n请务必考虑一下好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4220564735d3d592a822b2a2bc614d25956f01ae44e1551a74e323319a09bebe",
      "text": "我去当偶像……实在无法想象呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b19177b4cc4a6a4a00621867ccef017ef24215e77da16aeb6b1cc2dfb33b82a",
      "text": "啊啊，送到这里就可以了。\n我家就在前面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f14b67b10556e9d4a8a704884dec4298ce444c74b39f2887f98dfa2c5566e2",
      "text": "那么，我就送到这里。\n关于发掘的答复，我随时等候您的消息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32d00683932541e3bcc69baa69467399ed6ef7fcc822f2e8c25cf6d59db11f8",
      "text": "（答复……不用想也知道吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eb0948e71d9d0ae594c43215526c091b7de07daa571113e77af399d9902d3a7",
      "text": "（让我站在耀眼的台前，\n这种事……根本不可能做到的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ebe019c0b05c98ed234f2513cc772ddb92d547d4610be94e99be9aeee7b774b",
      "text": "圭，你在那种地方做什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:178190800d38862ba1bff7295255fc57624df52b4e9d0b93d531042af26c8e2e",
      "text": "哎呀，你要出门吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:215a9ef3ed5d6232001c1de78e1d5f89c7571d1a080ebd0a4956b4b8b0096afc",
      "text": "不是。我看你不在家，还以为你又没打伞\n跑到外面去了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414764d641e62e9eaf891780b7de4de74410665feb774712fb7faefa67fa504e",
      "text": "真是的，跑出来找你果然是对的。\n这不是浑身都湿透了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8bf5b9bfd6dbb17856ab22921e2b7cf5c85088f2e312cd1cd441ca05a6a4fc8",
      "text": "今天的雨声，比平时更加欢快呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc47f099c42d2751a8fea8491d24832e13cee49c53cf099b5350e901dab117a",
      "text": "知道了，知道了啦，总之先进屋去吧。\n再这样下去，真的要感冒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f7ca33415416cc2db08b6105f3d6ac205ee510d6ea9253473274b870db2e67",
      "text": "呵呵，刚才我也被人说了同样的话哦。\n有个人来发掘我去当偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_01_1_1_003_01:1_1_003_01_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a81ef702b4b1d6a20d88a8c55573270f89c030d35d4ad66afd83a890882cd032",
      "text": "……偶像！？你吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
